I know you that I know you also feel
this way like I to the orderly.

00:53:55.079 --> 00:53:57.871
Absolutely. Everybody has to be perfect.

00:53:57.871 --> 00:53:59.538
Not only do they have to be orderly. Yes.

00:53:59.579 --> 00:54:04.496
That's the whole goal of a sandwich for
